cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use this software, please cite the software version and exact commit
  or archive identity used. See CITATION.md for experiment identification.
type: software
title: KAHM forecasting demonstrator
authors:
  - given-names: Mohit
    family-names: Kumar
version: 0.2.0
license: Apache-2.0
repository-code: https://github.com/MohitKumarRostock/certified-kahm-representations-forecasting
abstract: >-
  A standalone demonstration of KAHM representations for scalar forecasting,
  with lower confidence bounds on optimal risk over prescribed Lipschitz
  decoder classes, upper confidence bounds on fitted-predictor risk,
  admissibility checks, a blockwise risk hierarchy, verified numerical
  witnesses, and independent finite-benchmark population audits.
keywords:
  - KAHM
  - forecasting
  - representation learning
  - Lipschitz regression
  - risk certification
  - reproducibility
